7980:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICSelection specifies the input to be used.
7981:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7982:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_DIRECTTI: TIM Input 4 is selected to be connected to IC4.
